## 4. Iconography

- **Library:** Lucide-React (locked — no Phosphor, no Heroicons, no mixing).
- **Stroke width:** 1.5px global default.
- **Size scale:** 14 / 16 / 20 / 24px.
- **No filled icons.** No emoji in UI chrome (emoji allowed in user-generated content only).

