## 8. What NOT to Build

To prevent generic-SaaS drift:

- ❌ Aurora / blob / mesh-gradient backgrounds.
- ❌ Stock isometric illustrations or 3D blob shapes.
- ❌ Emoji in UI chrome (status, nav, buttons).
- ❌ Stacked gradient buttons (cyan → violet). Use solid cyan with subtle glow on hover.
- ❌ Generic stock photography of "diverse teams in offices."
- ❌ Marquee logo carousels.
- ❌ Light mode toggle (v1).
- ❌ A clone of 11x.ai's hero — they're inspiration, not a template.

