## 10. Component Library Posture

- Use **shadcn/ui** as the base (Radix primitives, accessible by default).
- Theme shadcn components against the tokens in §1.
- **Do not** rebuild Dialog, Dropdown, Tooltip, Popover, Toast, Tabs, Select, or Command from scratch. If shadcn doesn't ship it, build on top of Radix primitives.
- Custom-built (not from shadcn): Live Feed, Pipeline Visualizer, Autonomy Control, Danie Status Chip.

