## 11. Definition of Done (per component)

A component ships only when it has:

- [ ] Tokens used (no hex literals in JSX/CSS).
- [ ] Keyboard navigation.
- [ ] Focus-visible state.
- [ ] Empty / loading / error states.
- [ ] `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback (if animated).
- [ ] AAA contrast for text, AA for controls.
- [ ] Mobile breakpoint behavior.
- [ ] Storybook story (or equivalent isolated demo).

